# HOSTMAN-FRONTEND — environment template.
# Copy to .env and adjust per environment. Never commit real .env (§10).

# Backend target for the DEV-ONLY API proxy (vite.config.ts server.proxy).
# Server-side only — intentionally NOT VITE_-prefixed so it can never be
# exposed to or inlined into the client bundle (§10). In production the app is
# served behind the reverse proxy that forwards /api, /healthz, /readyz to the
# backend (§15), so this variable is unused there.
# Backend default (docs/backend-api/README.md): http://127.0.0.1:8080
API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8080
